Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.13,0:00:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, see, the liquid-metal terminators were created in the future by Skynet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.13,0:00:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是的 液体金属终结者 是由天网在未来制造的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.17,0:00:07.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and Skynet was developed by Miles Dyson...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.17,0:00:07.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而天网是由麦尔斯戴森研发出的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:11.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but that future no longer exists due to Dyson's death in Terminator 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:11.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但因为戴森的死 那个未来 在《终结者2》里已经不复存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:14.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, then riddle me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:14.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 那你说说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Assuming all the good terminators...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假设所有好的终结者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:18.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...were originally evil terminators created by Skynet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:18.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都是天网制造的邪恶终结者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then reprogrammed by the future John Connor, why would Skynet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后被约翰康纳在未来重新设定程式 那为何天网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:24.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...an artificial computer intelligence...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:24.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一台人工智能电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:28.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...bother to create a petite, hot, 17-year-old killer robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要制造出一个十七岁的辣妹杀戮机器人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Skynet is kinky? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为天网性变态？我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Artificial intelligences do not have teen fetishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}人工智能电脑才不会迷恋美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-All right, wait. They use it to lure-- -Eh! Too late, I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好…我知道了 它们用它来引诱…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太迟了…我赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY SINGING "OUT TONIGHT"]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's go out tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:54.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to go out tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:57.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:57.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:02.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. But if cats could sing...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:03.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 但如果小猫能唱歌的话 它们也会觉得受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:03.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they'd hate it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY [SINGING]: You wanna prowl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:13.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Be my night owl? Well, take my--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:14.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:14.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, where are you going? -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 你们要去哪？ -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:20.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We just had to mail some letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要去寄信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And throw away some chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}顺便把鸡肉丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:43.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll never guess what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:43.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有件事你们一定猜不到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:44.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I give up. -I don't guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:44.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我放弃 -我从来不猜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:48.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As a scientist, I reach conclusions based on observation and experimentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:48.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身为科学家 我通过观察和实验得到结论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Although it occurs to me, you may have been employing a rhetorical device...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我有想到 你有可能采取明知故问的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...rendering my response moot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}企图引出我的论点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What was that? -Believe it or not, personal growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他说什么？ -说来你或许不信 这算是个人成长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:00.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:00.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember when I auditioned for Rent but I didn't get it and I couldn't figure out why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得我去参加《吉屋出租》试镜 却没被选中 我想不通究竟为什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a conclusion based on an observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据观察 我有个结论
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没 他没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The girl picked to play Mimi, she dropped out and they asked me to replace her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}演咪咪的那个女孩退出了 他们要我接她的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:16.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh! Congratulations, what a lucky break. -It's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-恭喜你 你真幸运 -这没什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just one night, but they invite casting people and agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是一个晚上 但他们邀请了许多选角经纪公司的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:20.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:20.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说不定我会走大运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I think I know. -No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我想我知道 -不 你不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:27.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He doesn't. -It's this Friday at 8, you guys wanna come?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:27.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这周五晚上八点 你们来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不要 -不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:35.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because Friday, we are attending a symposium...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:35.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为周五我们要去参加一场座谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:36.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on molecular positronium.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:36.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}分子学座谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I think that's a week from Tuesday at 6. -No, it's this Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我记得好像是下周二下午六点 -不 是这个周五
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:43.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-At 8. -Oh, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:43.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-晚上八点 -那真是太不巧了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I gotta get to rehearsal. See you guys. -See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我得去排练了 回头见 -再见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:51.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY [SINGING]: Let's go out tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You just lied to Penny. -Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你刚对佩妮说谎 -是的 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you did it so casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可你一副没事的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No rapid breathing, no increase in perspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有呼吸急促 发汗量未增加
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -So lack of a physiological response...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那又怎样？ -说谎时未出现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:04.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while lying is characteristic of a violent sociopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:04.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}任何生理反应是一种暴力变态狂的特征
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, are you worried about your safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你担心自己的安全吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:11.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I imagine if you were going to kill me, you'd have done it a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:11.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不担心 如果你要杀我的话早就下手了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那倒是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:03.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:03.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:05.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard? LEONARD: What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:05.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德？ -什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's 2:00 in the morning. -It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-现在是凌晨两点 -是很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I highly doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:14.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别蒙我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走开
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:22.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you still out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:22.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还站在门口吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right, it can wait until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对 明天早上再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:35.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: What, what, what? -Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:35.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-到底什么事？ -算了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I clearly woke you up in the middle of a REM cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然我在你熟睡状态下叫醒了你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.28,0:04:41.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're in no state of mind to talk. -Sheldon, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.28,0:04:41.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你现在状况不适合对话 -谢尔顿 到底什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:46.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm uncomfortable having been included in your lie to Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:46.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被你牵扯到对佩妮的谎言里让我觉得很不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:50.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What was I supposed to say? -You could have told her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:50.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那我该说什么？ -你应该告诉她实话的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That would have hurt her feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那会伤了她的心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:55.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that a relevant factor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:55.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是相关因素吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:56.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:56.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I suppose you could have agreed to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我想你应该答应说要去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:01.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what would I have said afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:01.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在那之后我又该说些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would suggest something to the effect of:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会建议你说类似的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:07.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Singing is neither an appropriate vocation nor avocation for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:07.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“你不适合唱歌 不管你把它当职业还是副业
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and if you disagree, I recommend a CAT scan to look for a tumor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不同意 我建议你去做个造影 看脑子里是不是有肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:14.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...pressing on the cognitive processing centers of your brain."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:14.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}压住了你大脑的认知处理中心”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:16.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I couldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:16.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would have to say, "You were terrific and I can't wait to hear you sing again."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只能说：“你唱得很棒 我真等不及再听你唱歌”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the social protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是社交礼仪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:26.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's what you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:26.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:30.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when you have a friend who's proud of something they really suck at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:30.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为某件事感到骄傲 就算他真的很烂 你也得这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was not aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道还有这一套
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:35.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, now you are. -Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:35.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-现在你知道了 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:37.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard? -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:37.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德？ -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:41.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When we played chess earlier, you were terrific, and I can't wait to play you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:41.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们之前下棋时 你下得很好 我真等不及再和你下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:48.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Leonard? Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard? Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:54.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This would be so much easier if I were a violent sociopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:54.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要是暴力变态狂 一切就好办多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard? Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -I was analyzing our lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -我分析了我们的谎话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I believe we're in danger of Penny seeing through the ruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得佩妮很有可能会看穿我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:06.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How? -Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:06.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么会？ -很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she were to log on to www. socalphysicsgroup.org/activities/other...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她上www.socalphysics group.org/activities…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...click on upcoming events, scroll to seminars, download the PDF schedule...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}点击“近期活动” 拉到下面的“会议” 下载安排表
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:18.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and look for the seminar on molecular positronium, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:18.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后查看分子学座谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:22.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...bippity boppity boo, our pants are metaphorically on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:22.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后 噼里啪啦砰 咱们就火烧屁股了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, sir, my trousers will not be igniting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可不想被火烧屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:34.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:34.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:39.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:39.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-早安 -你知道现在几点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.15,0:06:41.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do you have any idea what time it is? -Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.15,0:06:41.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:45.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My watch is linked to the atomic clock in Boulder, Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:45.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的表和科罗拉多州博尔德的原子时钟相连
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:48.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's accurate to one-tenth of a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:48.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准确度到十分之一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:50.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As I'm saying this it occurs to me once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:53.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我再度想到你这问题有点像是明知故问
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...your question may have been rhetorical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:57.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember how Leonard told you we couldn't come...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:57.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得莱纳德告诉你我们不能去看你的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:07:01.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because we were attending a symposium on molecular positronium?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:07:01.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为我们要参加分子学座谈会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I remember symposium.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:05.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我记得座谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, well, he lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 他在说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He lied, and I'm feeling very uncomfortable about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说谎了 我对整件事感到非常不安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:16.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, imagine how I'm feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:16.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你想想看我会是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肚子饿？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}疲惫？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:25.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, this really isn't my strong suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:25.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 这种事我特别不在行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:27.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You told her I lied?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:27.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你告诉她我说谎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would you tell her I lied?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么告诉她我说谎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:34.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I'm not seeing the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:34.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉 可我看不出你帮了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:37.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was going to see through your lie eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:37.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她终究会看穿你的谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so I told her that you were lying to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我为了保护自己告诉她你说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LEONARD GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm getting a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有很不好的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hunger?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肚子饿？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Indigestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}消化不良？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I'm really not very good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉 我对这种事真的很不在行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:53.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, Penny now believes that on Friday night...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:53.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在佩妮认为周五晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:57.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we're going to participate in my cousin Leopold's drug intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:57.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要去参加我表弟李奥波德的戒毒劝导会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your cousin Leopold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你表弟李奥波德
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:02.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whom most people call Leo, but he also answers to Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:02.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大部分人叫他李奥 有时叫他李他也会应答
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember that, it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这点要记得 很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:06.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's important? -Details, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:06.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么很重要？ -细节啊 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The success or failure of our deceitful enterprise turns on details.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谎言会不会被拆穿 全靠细节
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do you have a cousin Leopold? -No, I made him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有个叫李奥波德的表弟？ -没有 我瞎编的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you'd call him Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你会叫他“李”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't get it. I already told her a lie, why replace it with a different lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不明白 我已经对她说谎了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛又用另一个谎言取代那个谎言？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, first of all, your lie was laughably transparent...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先 你的谎言很容易被识破
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:28.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where mine is exquisitely convoluted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:28.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我的谎言却比较错综复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:34.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While you were sleeping, I was weaving an un-unravelable web.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:34.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在睡觉时 我编了一个天衣无缝的谎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Un-unravelable? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-天衣无缝？ -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:39.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she Googles Leopold Houston, she'll find a Facebook page...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:39.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她上网查李奥波德休斯顿 就会找到一个脸书的页面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.98,0:08:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...an online blog depicting his descent into drug use...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.98,0:08:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个网上博客 描述他沦落为毒虫的经过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and a desperate yet hopeful listing on eHarmony.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还能在交友网站上找到 他绝望而又不失希望的好友列表
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, why would I go to a drug intervention for your cousin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 那我为什么要去参加你表弟的戒毒劝导会？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:54.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah! Because it's in Long Beach and I don't drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:54.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为是在长滩 而我不会开车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're going to Long Beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要去长滩？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.29,0:09:00.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course not, there's no cousin Leo, there's no intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.29,0:09:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不会 我没有叫李奥的表弟 也没什么劝导会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Focus, Leonard. -Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-专心点 莱纳德 -拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:07.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We just leave the house on Friday night and return in the wee hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:07.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们周五晚上出去 然后半夜回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:11.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...emotionally wrung out from the work of convincing Leo to go back into rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:11.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一副精神不济的样子 因为我们费尽口舌劝李奥回戒毒所
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So he goes back into rehab?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要回戒毒所？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:18.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but he can relapse if Penny ever invites us to hear her sing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:18.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 但如果佩妮再邀我们去听她唱歌 他就有可能会毒瘾复发
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You still told her I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还是告诉了她我说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, for a noble purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 但你的动机很高尚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:26.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To spare me the social embarrassment of having a drug-addled first cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:26.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了不让我因为有个毒虫大表弟而被别人看不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Which I'm assuming is embarrassing, yes? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我猜这种事应该很丢人 对吧？ -我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:34.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How am I supposed to remember all this? -That's the best part, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么可能记得这些？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:34.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最棒的是你不必记住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told Penny that you would be embarrassed if you knew she found out you had lied...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉佩妮如果你知道她发现你说谎 你会觉得很不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so she's agreed to operate as if the original lie is still in force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以她同意表面上仍维持原来的谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:50.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So she's expecting me to lie about going to a symposium in Pasadena...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:50.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以她认为我骗她说要去帕萨迪纳参加座谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when in actuality, we're pretending to go to a drug intervention in Long Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但事实上我们是假装要去长滩参加戒毒劝导会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:57.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Un-unravelable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:57.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天衣无缝吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:04.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, Penny. Wow, look at you, all ready for your showcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:04.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 佩妮 哇哦 瞧瞧你 已经准备好上台演出了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You look great. PENNY: Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你真好看 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wanted to come by and wish you guys luck with your symposium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我过来祝你们去座谈会一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:12.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:15.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, thank you. -You know, I gotta tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:15.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你 -我必须告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.57,0:10:18.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A lot of friends would let their friend go alone, but that's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.57,0:10:18.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很多人都会让他们的朋友自己去但你不是那种人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are the kind of guy who stands by a friend when....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是那种会给予朋友支持
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:26.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When he has a symposium to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:26.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当他必须去参加“座谈会”的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:35.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's okay, Leonard. -Oh, okay, all right, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 好的 真好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:37.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, boy, group hug. -Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:37.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要大家一起抱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:41.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh-uh? -Okay. So, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:41.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:46.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Penny is on her way to perform in a one-night showcase production of Rent...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:46.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮要去演只表演一晚的《吉屋出租》舞台剧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:49.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which we are unable to attend, because we're going to a symposium...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:49.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没办法去 因为我们要去参加座谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:54.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on molecular positronium given by Dr. Emil Farmanfarmian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:54.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主题是分子学正电子素 主讲人为伊米尔法蒙法米安博士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:58.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute, Farmanfarmian is speaking and you're bogarting the symposium?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:58.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 法蒙法米安举行演讲 你们要暗自跑去听座谈会？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:02.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard, I'm sorry, we would've-- -No, no, you're quark-blocking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:02.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 对不起 我们… -不 你们故意不告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard-- -It's your Millennium Falcon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 听着… -没事 那是你们的千年隼号…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you and Chewbacca do whatever you wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和楚巴卡想怎样就怎样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:18.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me and Princess Leia here will find some other way to spend the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:18.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和莉亚公主今晚会找点事情打发时间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:20.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:20.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I think we should tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们应该告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:27.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't see a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:27.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:31.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no symposium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:31.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有所谓的座谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard lied to me. Isn't that right, Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:34.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德对我撒谎了 是不是 莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't know what to say. -It's okay, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不知道该说什么 -没关系 我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Leonard is helping Sheldon through a family crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德正在帮谢尔顿渡过家族危机
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:46.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He made up the whole story about the symposium with Dr. Farmanfarmian--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:46.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他编了一个参加法蒙法米安博士座谈会的谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:48.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good for you. -Ha! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你记性真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He didn't want Sheldon to be embarrassed. There's nothing to be embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他不想让谢尔顿觉得丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every family in America has a relative...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那一点也不是丢脸的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...holed up in a garage somewhere huffing paint thinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:56.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在美国每个家庭 都会有个亲戚…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.01,0:11:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}躲在车库里偷偷摸摸闻油漆稀释剂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm lost too. I think she skipped a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我也迷惑了 我想她漏掉了一步
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:07.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, look, Sheldon's cousin Leo escaped rehab and he's in a Motel 8 in Long Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:07.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿的表弟李奥从戒毒所偷跑出来 现在住在长滩的汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:10.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The whole family's going out for an intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:10.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的家人要去那里举行戒毒劝导会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:13.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard is driving Sheldon down to help him through this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:13.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德要开车载谢尔顿过去处理这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:17.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...because he's such a good man. -Oh, another hug? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:15.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他是个大好人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又抱了一次？谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.49,0:12:21.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-All right, you guys. Good luck. -Thanks, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.49,0:12:21.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好了 各位 祝你们好运 -谢了 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Break a leg. -Yeah, break a leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-祝你演出成功！ -对 祝你演出成功！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So road trip to Long Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们开车去长滩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:28.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We're not going to Long Beach. -Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:28.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 我们不去长滩 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:31.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because Sheldon doesn't have a drug-addicted cousin Leopold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:31.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为谢尔顿根本没有一个毒虫表弟李奥波德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've always wanted to go to Long Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直都想去长滩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:39.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a very nice community. The Queen Mary is docked there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那社区还不错 玛丽王后号就停在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:43.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Once the largest liner in the world, it's now a hotel and restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:43.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它曾经是全世界最大的轮船 现在变成了酒店兼餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where they host a surprisingly gripping murder-mystery dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}专门提供扣人心弦的悬疑惊悚谋杀案晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sounds fun. -I'm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听起来挺好玩的 -我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:50.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Shotgun. -No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:50.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要坐前面！ -不…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:54.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard gets nauseous unless he sits in front, and even then it's iffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:54.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德得坐前面 不然他会晕车 即便如此 他还是无法保证不会吐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:13:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, are we really going to Long Beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:13:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 我们真要去长滩？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（玛丽王后号）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:06.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Leonard? Leonard? Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let it go, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The murderer was the first mate whether it makes sense to you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再想了 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:15.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凶手就是大副 不管你觉得有没有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's the least of our worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那不是我们现在该担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:20.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been doing research on addiction...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:20.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我研究过毒瘾症状
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...both the biochemical and behavioral aspects...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生化与行为两个方面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:26.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I think there's a problem with the current version of our lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:26.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为咱们目前这个谎言有点问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:29.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you talking about? It's fine, she bought it, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:29.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在说什么？没事的 她已经相信了 这事过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:35.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sadly, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:35.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不幸的是并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Substance abuse is a lifelong struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毒瘾终身难戒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:40.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But beyond that, I have realized the Leo I described...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:40.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除此之外 我发现我所描述的李奥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:43.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...would not have agreed to go to rehab. -Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:42.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会同意去戒毒所的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:43.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么不去？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:45.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because Leo's a middle child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:45.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为李奥排行中间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:49.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no Leo. How can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:49.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本就没有李奥 你怎么能说他是排行中间？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:55.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't read the bio, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:55.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没看过他的介绍 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:58.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not just a middle child, he is the quintessential middle child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:58.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不仅是排行中间的孩子 还是最典型的排行中间的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:14:01.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From a broken home, to boot. Psychologically speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:14:01.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来自破碎家庭 就心理层面而言
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:05.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the attention he gets by rebelling, even to the point of destruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:05.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他通过叛逆得到情感关注 哪怕这条路带他走向自我毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:08.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is more emotionally valuable than help he would get at rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:08.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那也比戒毒所给他的帮助更令他感到欣慰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:10.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I've got a solution. -Great. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:10.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我有办法了 -太好了 是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:15.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:15.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:22.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've hesitated to point this out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:22.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这话我很不情愿说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I must remind you we are in our predicament...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我现在必须提醒你 我们现在陷入两难的境地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:27.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because of your initial and inadequate deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:27.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都是因为你一开始的谎言不够好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just trying to clean up after your mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想帮你收拾烂摊子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: We'll talk in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们明早再谈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:50.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:50.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:52.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:52.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am Sheldon's cousin Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是谢尔顿的表弟李奥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:57.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:57.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon does not have a cousin Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿才没有叫李奥的表弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:04.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Au contraire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:04.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正相反
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm 26 years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今年26岁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm originally from "Denton, Texas," but I was a Navy brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来自“德克萨斯州丹顿市” 但我是海军的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:14.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was brought up on a variety of military bases around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:14.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在世界各地的海军基地长大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:17.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As a result, I've often felt like an outsider, never really fitting in...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:17.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我总觉得自己是外人 总是无法融入
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...probably the reason for my substance-abuse problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许这就是我吸毒的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:23.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, we just went over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:23.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我刚不是跟你说了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:28.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As the middle child, your addiction is rooted in your unmet need for attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:28.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身为排行中间的孩子 你吸毒是因为想得到关注
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:31.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Sheldon, are we really gonna go with pop psychology?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:31.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们真的要应用通俗心理学的理论？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:34.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For your information, this is all based on solid research.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:34.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 这一切全都基于扎实的研究结果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:36.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just stick with the character profile I wrote for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:36.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以就照我给你写的角色背景演就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:38.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon? -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:38.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿？ -抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, this is Toby Loobenfeld.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 这位是托比卢本菲尔德
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a research assistant in the particle-physics lab...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是粒子物理实验室的研究助理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:46.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but he also minored in theater at MIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:46.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他在麻省理工学院也曾辅修过戏剧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.61,0:15:48.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was more of a double major, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.61,0:15:48.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实是双学位
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Theater and Physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}戏剧和物理学位
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:53.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can guess which one my bourgeois parents pushed me towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:53.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该能猜得出我的中产阶级父母要我朝哪条路走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 这是干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:59.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, while Leo would not have gone into rehab...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:59.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的 因为李奥不肯进戒毒所
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:03.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it is completely plausible that we would have talked him into leaving the motel...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:03.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们说服他离开旅馆来和我们一起住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:05.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...and coming home with us. -Oh....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:05.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全说得通
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:08.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, how about this as my motivation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:08.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 如果说我吸毒的起因是这样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:09.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was 14 years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:09.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我14岁时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I was abused in the Philippines by a clubfooted Navy chaplain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在菲律宾被海军里一名畸形足的牧师虐待
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, we're going with middle child and a genetic predisposition...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 还是坚持排行中间的说辞 由于血清素分泌不足
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:21.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to inadequate serotonin production.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:21.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}导致基因有成瘾的倾向
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Swell, well, how do I play genetic predisposition?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基因倾向怎么演？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:27.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Subtextually, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:27.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然是演内心戏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:29.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.49,0:16:32.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just have fun with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.49,0:16:32.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好好尽情发挥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Morning, Penny. -Hi. How did the intervention go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-早安 佩妮 -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unfortunately, we weren't able to convince him to go to rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}戒毒劝导会进行得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:46.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, based on what you told me, I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:43.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很不幸 我们没办法说服他去戒毒所
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据你的描述 我一点也不惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we did convince him to leave the motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们成功说服他离开汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:52.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:52.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来打声招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:58.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leo, this is Penny, our friend and neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:58.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}李奥 这位是佩妮 我们的朋友兼邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Leo, how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 李奥 你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:09.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me ask you something, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:09.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我问你一件事 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:13.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you ever woken up in a fleabag motel covered in your own vomit...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:13.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可曾在满是跳蚤的汽车旅馆里醒来 身上全是自己的呕吐物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:16.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...next to a transsexual prostitute?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:16.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身旁还躺着一个变性妓女？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:23.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Then don't ask me how I'm feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:23.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -那就别问我好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:27.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:27.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是李奥的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, why don't you tell me about your showcase last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 说说你昨晚的表演吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:33.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it was okay, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:33.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得还可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wasn't a big turnout, but they both seemed to like it.
