Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:07.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Desperate and alone, he reached out to a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:07.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝望寂寞的他向那个人寻求精神慰藉
