Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个人答应要介绍慈悲、有爱心的上帝给他认识
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but who instead introduced him to a gin-pickled tongue...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是最后他得到的却是满是酒味的舌头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:20.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...shoved down his adolescent throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:20.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伸进他那年少的喉咙
