Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:28.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but to drink, shoot and snort his pain away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:28.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只能酗酒、注射、吸毒 好麻木那种痛苦
